@host = http://localhost:5131

### All bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings

### New booking (Anna, Csoportszoba A, 10–12) → 201
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 3, "userId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 10, "endHour": 12, "peopleCount": 2, "note": "Prog ZH" }

### Conflict: ugyanaz a terem 11–13 → 409
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 3, "userId": 3, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 11, "endHour": 13 }

### No conflict → 201
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 3, "userId": 3, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 12, "endHour": 14 }

### Anna in two rooms at the same time → 409
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 4, "userId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 11, "endHour": 12 }

### Too long (5 hours) → 400
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 5, "userId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 10, "endHour": 15 }

### Over capacity (1 person room, 3 people) → 400
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 1, "userId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 14, "endHour": 15, "peopleCount": 3 }

### Modification (the first new booking's id is 5) → 200
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/5
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 3, "userId": 2, "date": "2026-11-27", "startHour": 15, "endHour": 17, "peopleCount": 2 }

### Deletion → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/5

### Non-existent booking → 404
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/999